# ==========================================
# Postman GitIgnore Configuration
# ==========================================

# ------------------------------------------
# 1. Sensitive Data & Secrets
# ------------------------------------------
# Ignore environment files containing real secret API keys, tokens, or credentials.
# Keep template/public environments (e.g. dev, staging) tracked, but ignore local/private credentials.
*.local.json
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml
*.secret.json
*.secret.yaml
*.secret.yml
*.private.json
*.private.yaml
*.private.yml
*.env.json
*.env.yaml
secrets.*

# Local developer overrides & private environment variables
environments/*local*
environments/*secret*
environments/*private*

# ------------------------------------------
# 2. Test Execution & CLI Reports
# ------------------------------------------
# Generated test run reports from Newman or Postman CLI
newman/
reports/
postman-reports/
*.html
*.xml
*.log

# ------------------------------------------
# 3. OS & Temporary Files
# ------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*.dump
